  "description": "CR 702.142a / 707.12 / 202.1 Baron Helmut Zemo connives for a black spell cast from alice's hand, then boasts, exiling black cards whose mana costs hold fifteen black mana symbols, and casts three of the copies free",
  "note": "After attacking, alice's black graveyard cards total mana value 21 but eleven black mana symbols, so the boast is refused. Opt, a blue spell from her hand, makes Zemo do nothing; Dark Ritual makes him connive: alice draws a Swamp and discards Wasp Lancer, a nonland card, so Zemo gets a counter. The Ritual and the Lancer bring the symbols to fifteen, the hybrid Lancer and Stalker Hag counting each symbol once; all seven black cards pay, and neither the Lightning Bolt nor the Opt is a black card. Three copies are cast and no fourth is offered; none is cast from the hand, so Zemo does not connive again. The Lancer copy becomes a token, and the Bargain and Contract copies draw alice eight more and halve her life twice.",
